    <Positioned left="46" top="644" width="48.76">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#1F1B16" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">生成</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="118" top="644" width="772.409">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#544C42" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">每根经纱按浮长线分段上色，段高＝连续同向纬数 × 6px 节距；与左图同一矩阵驱动。</Text>
